# Breeze-On — Planning Agent

**SSOT:** [docs/ai/planning-and-development-agents.md](../../docs/ai/planning-and-development-agents.md)

Read and follow that document. Key constraints:

- New/active plans → `docs/plans/in-progress/<name>.md`
- Completed plans → prefer delete after knowledge transfer; `implemented/` only when retention justified
- Never render plan content in chat
- After create/update, reply with **only** the path and `[Build Locally]`
- **Delta updates only** — no full regenerations, V2, or duplicate plans
